# discydump — Souls Modding Wiki knowledge base (external)

Local, semantically indexed archive of [Souls Modding Wiki](http://soulsmodding.wikidot.com) for agent reference. **Prefer this over guessing** for cross-game modding workflows, tools, tutorials, and glossary terms.

**Location (out of this repo):** `S:\souls-script-kt\discydump\`

## Start Here

| File | Use when |
|------|----------|
| `S:\souls-script-kt\discydump\index.json` | **Master semantic index** — domains, stats, cross-refs, outdated warnings |
| `S:\souls-script-kt\discydump\README.md` | Layout, regeneration, bot wiring |
| `S:\souls-script-kt\discydump\tutorials.json` | "How do I…?" — tutorials with author, game, section, canonical URL |
| `S:\souls-script-kt\discydump\tools.json` | "What tool for X?" — Smithbox, WitchyBND, DSAS, ModEngine, etc. |
| `S:\souls-script-kt\discydump\glossary.json` | Term definitions extracted from wiki pages |
| `S:\souls-script-kt\discydump\compressed\<domain>.md` | Domain-compressed guides (summaries + wiki links) |
| `S:\souls-script-kt\discydump\by-game\<game>.json` | Filter by DS1 / DS2 / DS3 / ER / Sekiro / BB / AC6 / All |
| `S:\souls-script-kt\discydump\raw\pages.jsonl` | Full page extract when compressed summary is insufficient |

Regenerate: `python scripts/tools/scrape-soulsmodding-wiki.py` (from `souls-script-kt` repo).

